        "created_at": "2021-04-10T20:16:54.009Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The only piece it ever did on the fly to adapt was Adaptive Plating Subroutine. Otherwise it still is using its set programming to kill all humans.  In the alt timeline where X came from it would rebuild and upgrade itself after each defeat.  With Omnitron IX being built with the purpose of making the ultimate version of itself which became X.</p>",
