      {
        "id": 237116,
        "name": "Chris Fougere",
        "username": "fougerec",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/58f4c7/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2021-04-26T02:28:43.626Z",
        "cooked": "<p>While I’m not not new to Sentinels, it’s only been more recently that I’ve dove head in to the fandom and games (and Letter’s Page) with the release of the RPG.  I’ve been eyeing picking up the base game and then tracking down the expansions but before I had a chance I saw the DE announcement.  Absolutely 100% on board for it because of the new artwork.  That’s what made me decide to back it rather than pick up the current game.  I love the art that’s so evocative of different eras in comics history.</p>",
